  "headlines": {
    "CommonStateHeadline": "At shared-gradient common states, DenseOn Muon/NorMuon row-CV ratios to AdamW were 2.855/0.711 and their normalized exact stable ranks were 0.5772/0.4153.",
    "ConfirmationHeadline": "The validation-frozen three-seed paired nDCG@10 contrasts were DenseOn: Muon--AdamW -0.0306 [-0.0464, -0.0138] (negative), NorMuon--AdamW -0.0304 [-0.0446, -0.0138] (negative), NorMuon--Muon 0.0002 [-0.0126, 0.0084] (inconclusive).",
    "DiscoveryHeadline": "For AdamW/Muon/NorMuon respectively, DenseOn median final nDCG@10 was 0.5858/0.5901/0.5910, with 2/3/3 of four learning rates reaching the frozen AdamW reference. DenseOn median throughput ratios to AdamW were 1.00x/0.95x/0.93x for AdamW/Muon/NorMuon; Muon-family training was not faster on this stack.",
    "InterventionHeadline": "For AdamW/Muon/NorMuon respectively, DenseOn matched-step margin changes were 0.0009/0.0006/0.0005, final shared-start Muon--AdamW/NorMuon--Muon margin contrasts were 0.0024 (3/0/0)/-0.0007 (1/0/2), and mean hybrid-routing AdamW change was 0.0001. Frozen causal-chain tests: temporal 2/5, primary LOSO relative RMSE gains for loss/margin -0.237277/-0.688154; fixed-state loss/margin/tail/basis support 0/0/0/2 of 10; 84-row spectrum loss/margin RMSE gains -0.000150847/-7.12409e-05 versus matched basis -9.78894e-07/-3.39735e-05; matched decision gaps loss/margin -1.508471e-04/-7.124088e-05; joint result claimable negative. These tests constrain a spectral-component explanation but do not identify formal mediation of full-training BEIR gains.",
    "RepresentationHeadline": "For AdamW/Muon/NorMuon respectively, DenseOn unseen margins were 0.2499/0.2609/0.2611. The descriptive within-run margin-to-BEIR Spearman rho was 0.531 for DenseOn. In the explicitly post-hoc loss diagnostic, the corresponding trailing-training-loss-to-BEIR rho was -0.684."
  },
